        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard White\n- Roles: actor, opera singer, voice actor\n- Characters: Gaston\n- Organizations: Disney, Toon Disney\n- Products: Beauty and the Beast, House of Mouse, Night of 1000 Toons\n\nFacts:\n- Richard White is an American actor and opera singer.\n- Richard White is best known for voicing Gaston in Disney's Beauty and the Beast.\n- Richard White also voiced Gaston in the TV series House of Mouse.\n- On September 2, 2002, Toon Disney aired an all-night marathon of House of Mouse titled Night of 1000 Toons.",
